namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::Font::getFontCapHeight
\brief Get the height of an unaccented capital letter, such as H.

Use this metric to align an icon or control with the visible capitals in a label.
It excludes accents, descenders, and line spacing, unlike the full font ascent or height.

\param size Font size, using the same units as Port::drawText().
\param style Optional text style flags; defaults to textStyle_Plain.
\return Distance from the baseline to the top of the capital, in port pixels.
\see getFontAscent, getFontHeight

**/ }
